7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.lean#L122-L124","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.s3inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.s3inv","kind":"def","line":119,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.lean#L119-L120","doc":"`σ₃⁻¹ = σ₃ − (q − q⁻¹)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.s3m","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.s3m","kind":"def","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.lean#L117-L118","doc":"`σ₃` in the same representation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.s2m","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.s2m","kind":"def","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.lean#L115-L116","doc":"`σ₂` in the generic `(2,1)` representation of the Hecke algebra on `σ₂, σ₃`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.channel_ratio_C5_eq_reversed_C4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.channel_ratio_C5_eq_reversed_C4","kind":"theorem","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.lean#L103-L107","doc":"**The C5 channel ratio of `(W, G)` equals the C4 channel ratio of `(ιW, ιG)`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.trace_PGP_covariant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.trace_PGP_covariant","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.lean#L87-L91","doc":"The compression `P·G·P` is orientation-covariant: `tr(W·(P·G·P)) = tr(ιW·(P·ιG·P))`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.trace_bare_orientation_blind","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.trace_bare_orientation_blind","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.lean#L83-L85","doc":"The bare bond functional is orientation-blind: `tr(ιW·ιG) = tr(W·G)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.trace_WP_reversed","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.trace_WP_reversed","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.lean#L79-L81","doc":"The channel-relative normalisation is orientation-blind: `tr(W·P) = tr(ιW·P)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.trace_GP_eq_reversed_PG","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.trace_GP_eq_reversed_PG","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.lean#L74-L77","doc":"And symmetrically `tr(W·G·P) = tr(ιW·P·ιG)` (C1 forwards is C2 backwards). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.trace_PG_eq_reversed_GP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.trace_PG_eq_reversed_GP","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.lean#L69-L72","doc":"**C5 read forwards is C4 read backwards.** `tr(W·P·G) = tr(ιW·ιG·P)` for `ι P = P`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.isospinProj_comm_bond","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.isospinProj_comm_bond","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.lean#L57-L62","doc":"`P = a + b·σ` commutes with `G` iff `b·[σ, G] = 0`: the commutator of a projector with the\nbond is `b` times the commutator of the interface generator with it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.iota_fix_interface","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.iota_fix_interface","kind":"theorem","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/IsospinBondCompositionOrientation.lean#L51-L55","doc":"An anti-automorphism `ι` that fixes `σ` fixes every element `a·1 + b·σ` of the interface\nspan, in particular both isospin projectors. ","signatureChunk":0}]}